    ^{:line 70 :tag int} r ; next byte to read is chunks[0][r]
    ^{:line 71 :tag int} w ; next byte to write is chunks[len(chunks)-1][w]
    ^{:line 72 :tag int} size ; total buffered bytes
    ^{:line 73 :tag int64} expected)) ; we expect at least this many bytes in future Write calls (ignored if <= 0)


(go/var errReadEmpty (errors/New "read from empty dataBuffer"))



